{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25949","headline":"秋怀五首 二 · 鲍溶","name":"秋怀五首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"秋晓客迢迢，月清风楚楚。\n草虫夜侵我，唧唧牀下语。\n流年白日驰，微愿不我与。\n心如缫丝纶，展转多头绪。\n凭觞散烦襟，援瑟清夜拊。\n回感帝子心，空堂有烟雨。\n丝减悲不减，器新声更古。\n一弦有余哀，何况二十五。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"鲍溶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_25949.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25949","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}